name: Recorded scope and original grant remain distinct from refreshed limits
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/run_request_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 3
expect: Protected review calls: 1
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | approved
paste-file: @ART/failure-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 35 failed | failed-request
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/run_request_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART before
paste-file: @ART/failed-replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Scope app | recorded-request
expect: calls 1/3 at read
keys: Tab Tab
require-live-snap: 25 RECORDED REQUEST AND LIMITS | original-receipt
expect: Run grant: owned-deep-discovery r1; 3 calls total
expect: Latest ledger at read: r1; 1/3 calls committed
expect: 1 protected Review
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/run_request_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART revise @TMP_HOME
live-snap: limits-before-refresh
expect: calls 1/3 at read
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 calls 1/5 at read | refreshed-receipt
expect: Run grant: owned-deep-discovery r1; 3 calls total
expect: Latest ledger at read: r2; 1/5 calls committed
expect: 1 protected Review
resize: 160x48
live-snap: request-160x48
expect: Run grant r1: 3 calls
expect: At read r2: 1/5 calls
expect: 1 Review protected
resize: 96x89
live-snap: request-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: request-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: request-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 25 calls 1/5 at read | request-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: receipt-tail-40x12
ask: Are the requested app scope, original three-call grant and refreshed five-call totals understandable without implying new work or complete coverage?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/failed-replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Scope app | restarted-request
expect: calls 1/5 at read
keys: Tab Tab
require-live-snap: 25 Run grant: owned-deep-discovery r1; 3 calls total | restarted-receipt
expect: Latest ledger at read: r2; 1/5 calls committed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/run_request_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 25 calls 1/5 at read | restarted-request-40x12
ask: Does plain-color restart retain the historical scope and grant while showing the latest read with protected Review intact?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
